meta {
  name: 02 Auth
  seq: 3
}

docs {
  lib-rustauth's routes under `/api`, and its guard in front of Copilot's routes.

  Registers a run-unique account (the administrator when the database has none yet, with the
  `setupToken` that `scripts/test-bruno.sh` passes in) and stores its session token as `token`
  for later folders: `auth: bearer` with `token: {{token}}`.
}
